      "post_subject": "Holographer Humor",
      "content_md": "Dr Outlier, I too tried to find some jokes about holography and there seems to be a lack of them in the world. Here are some I made up. I think one or two may have been donated. If you have any you want to add, let me know.\n\n[http://www.holograms3d.com/JustForFun/just_for_fun.htm](http://www.holograms3d.com/JustForFun/just_for_fun.htm)",
      "signature": "",
