    {
      "post_id": 49333,
      "topic_id": 6126,
      "topic_title": "Holographer Humor",
      "forum_id": 45,
      "forum_name": "Beginning Holography",
      "author": "dcgman",
      "author_id": null,
      "post_date": "Tue Mar 27, 2007 5:41 pm",
      "post_datetime": "2007-03-27T22:41:00+00:00",
      "post_subject": "Holographer Humor",
      "content_md": "> What did one photon say to the other photon?Meeting like this destroys me.\n\nFollowing on from JohnFPs joke above, here's another along similar lines:\n\nWhat did one photon say to the other photon?\n\nCan I interfere with you?\n\n[/quote]",
      "signature": "",
      "attachments": [],
      "quotes": [],
      "is_first_post": false,
      "url": "https://holographyforum.org/forum/viewtopic.php?p=49333#p49333"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 49335,
      "topic_id": 6126,
      "topic_title": "Holographer Humor",
      "forum_id": 45,
      "forum_name": "Beginning Holography",
      "author": "DrOutlier",
      "author_id": null,
      "post_date": "Tue Mar 27, 2007 7:00 pm",
      "post_datetime": "2007-03-28T00:00:00+00:00",
      "post_subject": "Holographer Humor",
      "content_md": "They're both better than the, \"How many holographers does it take to screw in a light bulb?,\" I've been trying to come up with:\n\n1. None. They use lasers.\n\n2. None. Light bulbs aren't coherent enough.\n\n3. One, if it's a green safelight.\n\nIt only gets worse. Robert Petrie I am not.",
      "signature": "",
      "attachments": [],
      "quotes": [],
      "is_first_post": false,
      "url": "https://holographyforum.org/forum/viewtopic.php?p=49335#p49335"
    },
